---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
import AssetImage from "@/components/AssetImage.astro";
import SectionHeading from "@/components/SectionHeading.astro";
---

<Base title="Team | Global Enterprise" description="Meet the senior practitioners and frontier disciplines behind Global Enterprise’s future-facing advisory model." image="/media/original/team-studio-session.avif" keywords={["future-facing consulting team", "AI thought leadership", "strategy practitioners", "enterprise transformation leaders", "quantum intelligence"]}>
  <section class="bg-paper py-20 md:py-28"><div class="container-site grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.72fr] lg:items-end"><div><p class="eyebrow">The team</p><h1 class="section-title mt-7 max-w-5xl">A senior bench for questions that do not fit inside one discipline.</h1><p class="body-copy mt-8 max-w-2xl text-xl">Global Enterprise brings strategy, AI/ML, data, frontier research, architecture, change, and human capability close to the same decision.</p></div><div><div class="border-l-2 border-cobalt pl-6"><p class="font-display text-6xl font-medium tracking-[-0.08em] text-cobalt">04</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">Disciplines that stay close to the decision: strategy, intelligence, systems, and capability.</p></div><figure class="mt-8 overflow-hidden border border-line bg-white"><AssetImage src="/media/original/team-studio-session.avif" width={1536} height={1024} loading="eager" decoding="async" alt="An interdisciplinary team reviewing pinned papers in a modest studio" class="aspect-[16/9] w-full object-cover" /><figcaption class="border-t border-line px-4 py-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">The bench is strongest when judgment can travel between disciplines.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad bg-white"><div class="container-site"><SectionHeading eyebrow="How we are organized" title="The right people for the real question." /><div class="mt-14 grid gap-px border border-line bg-line md:grid-cols-2">{[{n:"Strategy",t:"Strategy & operating model",d:"Frame the mandate, choices, decision rights, and measures that give the work direction."},{n:"Technology",t:"Architecture & technology",d:"Connect cloud, data, automation, and enterprise platforms to the outcomes they need to support."},{n:"Foresight",t:"Research & foresight",d:"Bring market, policy, customer, and technology signals into high-consequence decisions."},{n:"Capability",t:"Leadership & capability",d:"Help teams build the culture, habits, and capability required to sustain a new way of working."}].map((role) => <div class="bg-white p-8 md:p-12"><span class="font-display text-2xl text-cobalt">{role.n}</span><h2 class="mt-16 font-display text-3xl font-medium tracking-[-0.04em]">{role.t}</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-md leading-relaxed text-muted">{role.d}</p></div>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad bg-paper"><div class="container-site grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-24"><div><p class="eyebrow">The senior bench</p><h2 class="section-title mt-5">Composure, range, and the courage to be precise.</h2></div><div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted"><p>We bring the level of experience the question requires, from executive framing through the architecture review, research design, operating rhythm, and change adoption that make the decision real.</p><p>The public site currently describes the bench by discipline rather than publishing named biographies, awards, or client endorsements. That is the remaining leadership-disclosure gap. During a qualified diligence conversation, ask for the current principal profile, role boundary, conflicts process, and permissioned reference path before relying on any individual or recognition claim.</p><p>More than two decades of emerging-technology and ITIL change practice gives us a long view without making us nostalgic. We are interested in what the institution must become next.</p><a class="btn-dark mt-2" href="/contact/">Request the principal profile path <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="bg-ink text-white"><div class="container-site flex flex-col gap-8 py-16 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between"><h2 class="max-w-2xl font-display text-4xl font-medium tracking-[-0.05em]">Work with people who can hold the whole system.</h2><a class="btn-primary" href="/careers/">Explore careers <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</Base>
